{
    "title": "Music Night All Mod Test&Color",
    "description": "Music Night All Mod Test&Color offers two exciting modes that blend creativity and rhythm, perfect for fans who love to engage with their favorite mods throughout the week.\r\n\r\n1. Coloring Mode\r\nImmerse yourself in our coloring game, featuring over 300 unique pages. Whether you\u2019re relaxing after a long day or looking to spark your creativity\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\nStart by pressing the \"Coloring Game\" button on the main screen.\r\nYou\u2019ll be taken to a gallery filled with pages of well-known characters, each outlined in black and white.\r\nSelect the character you wish to color, and you\u2019ll see a large image at the top and a palette of numbered colors at the bottom.\r\nSimply tap on the matching numbered areas in the image to start coloring. The easy-to-use interface ensures a seamless experience.\r\nStuck on a color? Use the hints located in the top left corner. If you run out of hints, watch a rewarded ad to earn more and keep coloring.\r\nOnce you complete coloring a character, you\u2019ll earn rewards like additional hints, which can help you progress through more pages.\r\nThe mode offers a calm, stress-free environment, with the option to turn off background music and sounds for a more serene experience.\r\n2. Mod Test Mode\r\nExperience the thrill of testing all your favorite mods in our Mod Test Mode, available every day of the week. Control characters\u2019 movements and sounds using simple directional arrows, and enjoy their unique animations.\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\nAccess the Mod Test Mode by pressing the button with four arrows on the main screen.\r\nYou\u2019ll find a list of characters that dance and move to different rhythms, perfect for testing across all seven days.\r\nSelect a character to enter the test screen. At the bottom, you\u2019ll see directional arrows that control the character\u2019s movements.\r\nWhen the character is idle, they\u2019ll groove to the beat. Press any arrow to make them perform different dance moves and sounds, giving you complete control over their actions.\r\nCustomize your experience by adjusting sound settings. Choose whether the character repeats sounds as long as you hold down an arrow or plays the sound just once.\r\nTest out various characters and create your own unique dance routines, making every session fresh and fun.\r\nAdditional Features\r\nFull Week Engagement: Both modes are designed for you to enjoy all week long, whether you\u2019re coloring or testing mods.\r\nSound and Music Control: In both game modes, you can turn off sounds and music completely if you prefer a quieter experience.\r\nRewards: Earn rewards for completing coloring pages or testing different characters, and use these to enhance your gameplay experience.\r\nShare with Friends: If you enjoy Music Night All Mod Test&Color, please don\u2019t forget to share it with your friends using the in-app share button. We appreciate your support and feedback.\r\nThis game is perfect for anyone looking to combine the creative challenge of coloring with the rhythmic excitement of mod testing. With engaging content for every day of the week, Music Night All Mod Test&Color is your go-to app for entertainment.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Music Night All Mod Test&amp;Color offers two exciting modes that blend creativity and rhythm, perfect for fans who love to engage with their favorite mods throughout the week.<br><br>1. Coloring Mode<br>Immerse yourself in our coloring game, featuring over 300 unique pages. Whether you\u2019re relaxing after a long day or looking to spark your creativity<br><br>How to Play:<br>Start by pressing the &quot;Coloring Game&quot; button on the main screen.<br>You\u2019ll be taken to a gallery filled with pages of well-known characters, each outlined in black and white.<br>Select the character you wish to color, and you\u2019ll see a large image at the top and a palette of numbered colors at the bottom.<br>Simply tap on the matching numbered areas in the image to start coloring. The easy-to-use interface ensures a seamless experience.<br>Stuck on a color? Use the hints located in the top left corner. If you run out of hints, watch a rewarded ad to earn more and keep coloring.<br>Once you complete coloring a character, you\u2019ll earn rewards like additional hints, which can help you progress through more pages.<br>The mode offers a calm, stress-free environment, with the option to turn off background music and sounds for a more serene experience.<br>2. Mod Test Mode<br>Experience the thrill of testing all your favorite mods in our Mod Test Mode, available every day of the week. Control characters\u2019 movements and sounds using simple directional arrows, and enjoy their unique animations.<br><br>How to Play:<br>Access the Mod Test Mode by pressing the button with four arrows on the main screen.<br>You\u2019ll find a list of characters that dance and move to different rhythms, perfect for testing across all seven days.<br>Select a character to enter the test screen. At the bottom, you\u2019ll see directional arrows that control the character\u2019s movements.<br>When the character is idle, they\u2019ll groove to the beat. Press any arrow to make them perform different dance moves and sounds, giving you complete control over their actions.<br>Customize your experience by adjusting sound settings. Choose whether the character repeats sounds as long as you hold down an arrow or plays the sound just once.<br>Test out various characters and create your own unique dance routines, making every session fresh and fun.<br>Additional Features<br>Full Week Engagement: Both modes are designed for you to enjoy all week long, whether you\u2019re coloring or testing mods.<br>Sound and Music Control: In both game modes, you can turn off sounds and music completely if you prefer a quieter experience.<br>Rewards: Earn rewards for completing coloring pages or testing different characters, and use these to enhance your gameplay experience.<br>Share with Friends: If you enjoy Music Night All Mod Test&amp;Color, please don\u2019t forget to share it with your friends using the in-app share button. We appreciate your support and feedback.<br>This game is perfect for anyone looking to combine the creative challenge of coloring with the rhythmic excitement of mod testing. With engaging content for every day of the week, Music Night All Mod Test&amp;Color is your go-to app for entertainment.",
